Package: skaters
Title: Online Distributional Time-Series Forecasting by Conjugation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "Cotton", , "peter.cotton@microprediction.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Port of the Python 'skaters' package: an online, univariate,
    distributional forecaster built from invertible transforms over a
    Gaussian-mixture leaf. Every implemented component is verified against
    the reference implementation's parity vectors to 1e-6.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends:
    R (>= 3.6.0)
Suggests:
    jsonlite
Encoding: UTF-8
